<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturday's spot rupee rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.14		 41.19</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	67.10		 67.20</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.30		 24.35</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.330		 0.332</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.96		 10.97</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.20		 11.21</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.08		  1.10</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.50 pct	    2.70 pct</p>
</text>
